`2result.sql` is the most reliable:

• It matches the exact tag names by using boundary‑aware regexp (`(^|\|)…(\||$)`), so only the intended Android tags are accepted.  
• It requires the title to begin with “how ”, satisfying the “most viewed ‘how’ question” requirement.  
• It guards against NULL tags / titles and orders by `view_count` to return the single highest‑viewed post.

```plaintext
2result.sql
```